{"id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-limits-colimits.md","title":"Definition — Limits and Colimits","display":"Definition — Limits and Colimits","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-limits-colimits","aliases":["14-df-limits-colimits"],"display":"Definition — Limits and Colimits","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-small-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-limits-colimits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-limits-colimits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Limits and Colimits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(J),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(J),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (categories, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(D_0,D_1)\">\\(D=(D_0,D_1)\\)</span> (object and morphism maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}\\)</span> (hom-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCone},\\mathrm{IsLimit},\\mathrm{IsCocone},\\mathrm{IsColimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCone},\\mathrm{IsLimit},\\mathrm{IsCocone},\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,Q,\\pi,\\kappa\">\\(L,Q,\\pi,\\kappa\\)</span> 是候选顶点和分量族。</p>\n<p>下式谓词均带固定环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 下标；仅在环境已绑定时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCone}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCone}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCocone}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCocone}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsColimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\)</span> 分别省略这个下标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\pi\\in\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,D_0(j))\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_J(j,k)\\;(D_1(\\alpha)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\pi_j=\\pi_k)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\phi\\;(\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\phi,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,L)\\;\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;(\\pi_j\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=\\phi_j))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\pi\\in\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,D_0(j))\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_J(j,k)\\;(D_1(\\alpha)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\pi_j=\\pi_k)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\phi\\;(\\mathrm{IsCone}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\phi,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,L)\\;\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;(\\pi_j\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=\\phi_j))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\leftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\kappa\\in\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D_0(j),Q)\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_J(j,k)\\;(\\kappa_k\\circ_{\\mathcal C}D_1(\\alpha)=\\kappa_j)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\psi\\;(\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\psi,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\;\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\kappa_j=\\psi_j))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\leftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\kappa\\in\\prod_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D_0(j),Q)\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_J(j,k)\\;(\\kappa_k\\circ_{\\mathcal C}D_1(\\alpha)=\\kappa_j)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\psi\\;(\\mathrm{IsCocone}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\psi,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\;\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\;(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\kappa_j=\\psi_j))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries。</p>\n<p>极限是锥的终对象，余极限是余锥的始对象；空指标给出终对象、始对象。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小指标，故后续“所有小极限”均有固定尺寸。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(J),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)$ (categories, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)$ (diagram, see [[14-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}$ (object-set operation, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}$ (hom-set operation, see [[14-df-morphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴（[[14-df-small-category]]）；$L,Q,\\pi,\\kappa$ 是候选顶点和分量族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(J),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)",