,"display":false}],"bytes":2691,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits|Definition — Limits and Colimits]]"},{"id":"1c7cd3fb1e4b272e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal I$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴。$\\mathrm{IsFiltering}(\\mathcal I)$ 使用本书 VII.6 的箭头朝向：两对象有共同来源，平行箭头可由前合成等化。有限范畴表示其对象集和箭头集均有限；锥谓词见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。"},{"id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsLimit}$ (limit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])"},{"id":"a48988fed4470569","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"87956cc8ea885899","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]"},{"id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsLimit}$ (limit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])"},{"id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的固定宇宙，所有小指标均指 $\\mathcal U$-小。$\\mathcal E$ 是候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsLocallySmall}$、有限极限、极限与余极限分别见 [[14-df-category]]、[[14-df-elementary-topos]]、[[14-df-limits-colimits]]。拉回见 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]，不交余积见 [[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]]。"},{"id":"173e95f9b43447c0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits|Definition — Limits and Colimits]]"},{"id":"8e2ae868c0cc48ee","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。$K,D$ 在 Assertion 中量化，小性、函子和余极限谓词分别见 [[14-df-small-category]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-limits-colimits]]；$\\mathbb N=\\omega$。"},{"id":"3a26eef9f2574e2f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1dc2712cae6cd02a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G$ 是 $(Y,\\nu)$ 上的层。茎公式的参数 $x$ 遍历 $X$；有限极限断言不要求 $X$ 非空。$I$ 为有限小范畴，$D:I\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)$ 为函子。选定极限锥 $(L,\\pi)$ 与 $(M,\\mu)$，满足 $\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)}(L,\\pi,D)$ 和 $\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(M,\\mu,f^*\\circ D)$；存在性使用 [[14-df-topological-open-site]] 及 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。$\\kappa$ 在下式由全部锥分量方程唯一确定。茎使用 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]；$\\pi_2$ 为集合论有序对的第二投影，下式中的 $t(x)$ 属于 $E_{f,G}$。"},{"id":"c9318ee07cf41c8b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d7f855ae975e0f6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"19ea095512403696","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,K$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$D:K\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 为图表。$D_C:K\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 的对象值为 $D(k)(C)$，箭头值为 $D(\\alpha)_C$。$L,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})$ 为候选顶点；$\\pi\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(L,D(k))$、$\\iota\\in\\prod_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(D(k),Q)$ 为候选锥、余锥的自然变换族。$\\pi_C=((\\pi_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}$、$\\iota_C=((\\iota_k)_C)_{k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)}$ 为其集合分量族；不预设它们满足锥方程。极限谓词见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。"},{"id":"e937528586d5f172","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsLimit}$ (limit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])"},{"id":"8a95d86314c18fd6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsLimit}$ (limit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])"},{"id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)$ 采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]，不以未指定的极限对象代替极限锥。"},{"id":"cbd8e35070d95035","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$a,\\eta$ 满足 $\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$（[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]）。极限见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。"},{"id":"0db90275ed4c618a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsColimit}$ (colimit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])"},{"id":"7bce595852a7663d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$0$ 是选定初对象，$z_X:0\\to X$ 在下式以初对象泛性质定义；$\\operatorname{IsInitial}$、积与指数见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]、[[14-df-exponentials]]。$\\operatorname{IsIso}$、$\\operatorname{IsMono}$ 在本范畴中解释。给定任意对象A、B，选取 [[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]] 所保证的二元余积数据 $(A+B,i_A:A\\to A+B,i_B:B\\to A+B)$，其余锥泛性质采用 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。推出与拉回签名见 [[14-thm-pushout-image]]、[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]。"},{"id":"cb7eec83c9952d6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c5452002ba29fda","1f1269584b34ad4b","898681611f432286"]}